{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "974a6d00ed74f32286e8ad39c495a34e7436e7a6df017cffb0514d54bc7ae874", "ja": "（ついに未来が、\n765プロ劇場のステージに立つ日がやってきた）", "zh": "（终于到了未来站上765艺能剧场舞台的日子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f72375ec5743694901731838f70852c465d00b588d0f88162335acf19ec2c36b", "ja": "（本人の様子は……待ちきれないみたいだな）", "zh": "（她本人看起来……很迫不及待呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "794bedd0e5e7b51f4fc928b86575a3d1f6bd1d3c2d967d21d1486515e6911564", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nライブ、始まりましたよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n演唱会开始了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "cf146c6890f541ddaf4e140dc0dd8203722ca16a6db4cdefff3b0195c4c20873", "ja": "わぁ……みんな、すごいな～……♪", "zh": "哇……大家都好厉害～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "15c60200a2f8bdd5ca379ae03d928e9c008106fee8df8f6ff6b1538234aa31ea", "ja": "感心してる場合じゃないぞ。\n今日は未来も、お客さんじゃなくて出演者だからな！", "zh": "现在不是佩服的时候喔。\n因为今天的未来不是观众，而是表演者啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "ddcec3b0999b88d3d38fdeb190d32bc016a10208881afb485614b0d7c1ccd110", "ja": "はいっ！\nじゃあ私も、みんなのところにいってきますっ！", "zh": "是！\n那我这就过去大家那边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "557dfb60d92df6731cd866ad160a128f64d53dc02430ab8489f313706926220e", "ja": "ちょっ……ストップ、ストップ！\n未来の出番は、まだだろ？", "zh": "等等……停下来、停下来！\n还没轮到未来出场吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "a1f21fdc5f3859c3c893b16378d02722e8c73a4b757da5ca78dcd7ee3df1cb0b", "ja": "あっ……そうでした。つい、張り切りすぎちゃって。\nでへへ……。", "zh": "啊……对耶，一不小心就太起劲了。\n嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d0f5568a7119281dc2f2067ac62990f2d31b0f325b113392e72d4a7f23881920", "ja": "気持ちはわかるけど、落ち着け。\n急に出て行っちゃったら、みんなも困るだろうし。", "zh": "我能理解你的心情，但冷静点。\n你突然跑出去的话，大家会伤脑筋的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "6d6e6a846643af89ab347c508096e3d9b134d5da404e1567d2ca28f38667520b", "ja": "そうでした……。勝手なことして、ライブが\nメチャクチャになっちゃったら大変ですよね。", "zh": "说得也是……要是我擅自行动，\n把演唱会搞得一塌糊涂就糟了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "906610dabd2bfa44af719f8a2235f01e4cc7ad73749245b2052a0b06e5d98dc7", "ja": "出番が来るまで、おとなしくしてなきゃっ！\n……ガマン、ガマン……うう～……。", "zh": "在轮到我之前，我要安分点才行！\n……要忍耐，要忍耐……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0e949b5cd3a9615f1a0c08d1bb04c4f01e186439cdf9e7522c0e02025ecefe13", "ja": "はは。\nその様子だと、緊張はしてないみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，\n看你这样子，似乎不太紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "60e3857ad5f397b326f573a25ef5c4ea008104a410a22c33ece1996859bd6bad", "ja": "緊張？\n……そういえば、忘れてました♪", "zh": "紧张？\n……这么说来，我都忘了要紧张了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "20dbb9c2d7ac48ba34c548a47244832eed88ba24a538e6df47987e0fc8a999d6", "ja": "私、ライブに出られるって聞いてから、\nずーっと楽しみで、ワクワクしてたんです！", "zh": "自从知道可以在演唱会上表演后，\n我就一直很期待、很兴奋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "66e7c6e78d1abeae76065059e0b32c485ae4a87089015605b3c5fd064a93a4fe", "ja": "授業中も、ライブのことばっかり考えてたら、\n先生に怒られちゃいましたけど……でへへ♪", "zh": "就连上课时也一直想着演唱会的事，\n结果被老师骂了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "dce4666ee6afc2ae8e08ffd44c6aed2b97d66d4d05314675e57311b40bfd4461", "ja": "でへへ、じゃないだろう。\n授業はちゃんと聞かないとダメだぞ。", "zh": "这种时候不该说「嘿嘿」吧。\n不好好上课可不行喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "0e43943555c1128b5b0127bd4e7fa55a6cb5a781a6914d37d8fe71a3d410188a", "ja": "はーいっ、気をつけます！", "zh": "好～我会注意的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "6a1ba371bbbc86c7dd16f461735e3355e1cbacf71bb8ec4455c0fe403113fb49", "ja": "でもでも、それくらい楽しみだったんですよ～！\nだから、だから……うう～。", "zh": "不过不过，这也代表我有多期待啊～！\n所以、所以……呜呜～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "3e70c99b038e8ac920e785c62a357de5b43a82819c1b2c62e115ce03e83a34c9", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nやっぱり、もう行ってもいいですか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n再问一下，我可以上台了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f8e9a4540c51d1e90a9c0c926978558ae01ce94726fd145bdd19fa1aea6361d1", "ja": "ああ、いいよ。", "zh": "嗯，可以啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4b7823a70cc299569035215978df425556fe18dca0a87efe47cfe5d1a5d8c565", "ja": "未来の出番だ！\nステージ、思いっきり楽しんでこい！", "zh": "轮到未来出场了！\n去尽情享受舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "e628831ec59193ec6c48abe75d222e851724dcff2594b069d56767cf359c3a7d", "ja": "は、はい！　みんなに負けないくらい、\nいっぱい、い～っぱい盛り上げてきちゃいますね！", "zh": "好、好的！我不会输给大家，\n会很努力、很～努力炒热气氛的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_003_1023_p", "source_sha256": "046f404c8217859de6f688403495f2f7e7701a67931813c31979061008f93437", "ja": "（元気いっぱいの笑顔で、弾けるように飛び出して\nいく。まぶしいほどに輝く……未来へ！）", "zh": "（她用充满活力的笑容，飞也似地跑了出去。\n跑向耀眼夺目的……未来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
